Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.48,Black,Credits,0,0,0,,Tradução: Vacalos e Mangas\NLegendas: Vacalos e Mangas / KevinVG207\N-Proibida a distribuição das legendas junto ao vídeo-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.70,0:00:18.21,Black,Daiwa Scarlet,0,0,0,,Por que eu sempre faço par com você?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.48,0:00:21.16,Black,Vodka,0,0,0,,Eu também gostaria de saber.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.16,0:00:26.34,Black,Tsurumaru Tsuyoshi,0,0,0,,Vamos lá, não fiquem brigando neste tempo tão bonito!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.60,0:00:29.75,Black,Daiwa Scarlet,0,0,0,,O que foi? Você está dizendo que não gosta de fazer par comigo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.75,0:00:33.10,Black,Vodka,0,0,0,,Foi você que reclamou primeiro, não foi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.10,0:00:35.35,Black,Daiwa Scarlet,0,0,0,,Ahh, cala a boca!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.82,0:00:35.35,Black,Vodka,0,0,0,,— Faça direito!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.35,0:00:35.39,Black,Daiwa Scarlet,0,0,0,,{\pos(1102.4,1136)\frz26.72}Ahh, cala a boca!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.35,0:00:35.39,Black,Vodka,0,0,0,,{\frz11.36\pos(1019.2,1014.4)}— Faça direito!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.39,0:00:35.43,Black,Vodka,0,0,0,,{\frz35.7\pos(1166.4,1156.8)}— Faça direito!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.21,0:00:39.70,Black,Daiwa Scarlet,0,0,0,,Aquela é...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.70,0:00:42.72,Black,Daiwa Scarlet,0,0,0,,Symboli Kris S!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.72,0:00:43.90,Black,Symboli Kris S,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.67,0:00:45.61,Black,Vodka & Daiwa Scarlet,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.39,0:01:00.02,Black,Daiwa Scarlet,0,0,0,,Ela invocou esta tempestade?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.02,0:01:03.90,Black,Vodka,0,0,0,,Sim, eu sinto uma aura insana vindo dela.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.90,0:01:05.20,Black,Tsurumaru Tsuyoshi,0,0,0,,Ela parece tão forte!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.20,0:01:08.53,Black,Tanino Gimlet,0,0,0,,Fuhahahahaha....
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.53,0:01:09.60,Black,Daiwa Scarlet,0,0,0,,Quem é agora?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.60,0:01:10.67,Black,Vodka,0,0,0,,Essa voz...!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.67,0:01:14.89,Black,Tanino Gimlet,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.76,0:01:14.88,Black,Vodka,0,0,0,,— Tanino Gimlet!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.51,0:01:19.31,Black,Tanino Gimlet,0,0,0,,Oh vento, devaste e destrua a ordem deste mundo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.31,0:01:25.69,Black,Tanino Gimlet,0,0,0,,Oh relâmpagos, usurpe esta chatice que gruda em meu corpo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.57,0:01:31.82,Black,Tanino Gimlet,0,0,0,,FU-HA-HA-HA-HA!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.82,0:01:31.86,Black,Tanino Gimlet,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HD7D36D&\1a&HF5&\pos(960,1020)\alpha&H0F&}FU-HA-HA-HA-HA!
